{"title":"Career Roadmap: Accounts Executive (Tally/ERP)","role":"Accounts Executive (Tally/ERP)","summary":"An Accounts Executive (Tally/ERP) manages day-to-day accounting and finance operations using accounting software and ERP systems. Typical responsibilities include journal entries, ledger maintenance, invoicing, bank reconciliation, accounts payable/receivable, GST/TDS support, payroll accounting, financial reporting and documentation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com - Computer Applications"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build accounting, taxation, ERP/Tally, Excel and financial-record management skills"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Accounts Executive (Tally/ERP) manages day-to-day accounting and finance operations using accounting software and ERP systems. Typical responsibilities include journal entries, ledger maintenance, invoicing, bank reconciliation, accounts payable/receivable, GST/TDS support, payroll accounting, financial reporting and documentation."},{"type":"p","text":"The modern role is increasingly technology-oriented. A graduate should therefore combine accounting knowledge + Tally/ERP + Excel + taxation fundamentals + data skills + ERP processes."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial accounting, business economics"},{"text":"Complete accounting-cycle case"},{"text":"Weak debit/credit concepts"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Computerized accounting"},{"text":"TallyPrime, Excel, GST/TDS basics"},{"text":"Maintain a simulated company ledger"},{"text":"Knowing software without accounting understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"ERP & professional accounting"},{"text":"ERP workflows, reconciliations, reporting"},{"text":"End-to-end accounting project"},{"text":"Only doing data entry"}],[{"text":"Final Stage"},{"text":"Job readiness"},{"text":"Advanced Excel, ERP, taxation, analytics"},{"text":"Internship + portfolio"},{"text":"Lack of practical exposure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Excel basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate Accounting"},{"text":"Cost Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Accounting standards concepts"},{"text":"Business documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TallyPrime"},{"text":"Computerized Accounting"},{"text":"Ledger management"},{"text":"Journal entries"},{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"Bank reconciliation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST fundamentals"},{"text":"TDS fundamentals"},{"text":"Accounts payable"},{"text":"Accounts receivable"},{"text":"Inventory accounting"},{"text":"Payroll accounting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ERP fundamentals"},{"text":"SAP/Oracle/Dynamics concepts"},{"text":"Financial reporting"},{"text":"MIS reporting"},{"text":"Power BI basics"},{"text":"Accounting data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"ERP workflow"},{"text":"Month-end closing"},{"text":"Audit support"},{"text":"Tax compliance support"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Final accounting automation project"}]}]},{"heading":"Accounting Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master the complete accounting cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Transaction","Journal","Ledger","Trial Balance","Adjustments","Financial Statements"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Debit and credit"},{"text":"Assets"},{"text":"Liabilities"},{"text":"Capital"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Expenses"},{"text":"Receivables"},{"text":"Payables"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Fixed assets"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Accruals"},{"text":"Prepayments"},{"text":"Provisions"},{"text":"Outstanding expenses"},{"text":"Advance payments"}]}]},{"heading":"Journal Entries","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should be able to record common transactions independently."},{"type":"h","text":"Examples"},{"type":"h","text":"Purchase on credit"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Purchase A/c Dr."},{"text":"To Supplier A/c"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales on credit"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer A/c Dr."},{"text":"To Sales A/c"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Salary paid"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Salary A/c Dr."},{"text":"To Bank/Cash A/c"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Depreciation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Depreciation A/c Dr."},{"text":"To Accumulated Depreciation A/c"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn entries involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST"},{"text":"Discounts"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"Advances"},{"text":"Loans"},{"text":"Interest"},{"text":"Fixed assets"},{"text":"Bad debts"},{"text":"Provisions"},{"text":"Payroll"}]}]},{"heading":"TallyPrime Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Tally should be learned as an accounting system, not merely as a data-entry tool."},{"type":"h","text":"Company Setup"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company creation"},{"text":"Financial year"},{"text":"Books beginning date"},{"text":"Company configuration"},{"text":"User permissions"},{"text":"Security controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Masters"},{"type":"p","text":"Create and manage:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ledgers"},{"text":"Groups"},{"text":"Stock items"},{"text":"Stock groups"},{"text":"Units"},{"text":"Godowns"},{"text":"Cost centres"},{"text":"Voucher types"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Vouchers"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment"},{"text":"Receipt"},{"text":"Contra"},{"text":"Journal"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Purchase"},{"text":"Sales return"},{"text":"Purchase return"},{"text":"Debit note"},{"text":"Credit note"}]}]},{"heading":"Tally-Based Accounting Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete business cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Purchase Order","Purchase","Inventory","Supplier Payable","Payment"]},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sales Order","Sales Invoice","Customer Receivable","Collection"]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Bank Transaction","Bank Reconciliation","Ledger","Trial Balance","Financial Statements"]}]},{"heading":"GST Accounting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build practical understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST structure"},{"text":"CGST"},{"text":"SGST"},{"text":"IGST"},{"text":"Input Tax Credit"},{"text":"Output GST"},{"text":"Tax invoices"},{"text":"Credit notes"},{"text":"Debit notes"},{"text":"GST reconciliation"},{"text":"GST return concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting entry","GST treatment","Return/reporting requirement"]},{"type":"p","text":"GST rules and rates can change, so current compliance work should always be performed using the applicable rules and professional guidance."}]},{"heading":"TDS & Tax Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TDS concept"},{"text":"Deductor/deductee"},{"text":"TAN"},{"text":"TDS entries"},{"text":"TDS payable"},{"text":"TDS receivable"},{"text":"Basic income-tax concepts"},{"text":"Advance tax concepts"},{"text":"Tax deductions"},{"text":"Form/document concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal at this level is accounting and compliance support, not independent tax practice."}]},{"heading":"Bank Reconciliation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master the Bank Reconciliation Statement (BRS)."},{"type":"p","text":"Identify differences caused by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cheques issued but not presented"},{"text":"Cheques deposited but not cleared"},{"text":"Bank charges"},{"text":"Interest credited"},{"text":"Direct deposits"},{"text":"Standing instructions"},{"text":"Bank errors"},{"text":"Accounting-entry errors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel/Tally-based BRS that automatically identifies unmatched transactions."}]},{"heading":"Accounts Payable & Receivable","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Accounts Payable"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vendor creation"},{"text":"Purchase invoices"},{"text":"Due dates"},{"text":"Payment schedules"},{"text":"Vendor reconciliation"},{"text":"Outstanding reports"},{"text":"Aging analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Accounts Receivable"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer creation"},{"text":"Sales invoices"},{"text":"Collections"},{"text":"Outstanding invoices"},{"text":"Customer reconciliation"},{"text":"Aging reports"},{"text":"Credit limits"},{"text":"Collection follow-ups"}]}]},{"heading":"Inventory Accounting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stock-in/out"},{"text":"Opening stock"},{"text":"Closing stock"},{"text":"Purchase"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"Stock adjustments"},{"text":"Stock valuation"},{"text":"Inventory reconciliation"},{"text":"Physical vs book stock"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FIFO"},{"text":"Weighted average"},{"text":"Cost of inventory"},{"text":"Stock turnover"}]}]},{"heading":"Payroll Accounting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gross salary"},{"text":"Basic salary"},{"text":"Allowances"},{"text":"Deductions"},{"text":"Employee advances"},{"text":"Employer contributions"},{"text":"Net salary"},{"text":"Payroll journal entries"},{"text":"Salary payable"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with the concepts surrounding:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EPF"},{"text":"ESI"},{"text":"Professional Tax"},{"text":"TDS on salary"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual statutory requirements depend on the applicable rules and employee/employer circumstances."}]},{"heading":"Excel Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Excel is one of the most important complementary skills for an Accounts Executive."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SUM"},{"text":"AVERAGE"},{"text":"IF"},{"text":"IFS"},{"text":"IFERROR"},{"text":"SUMIF"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIF"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"PivotCharts"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Named ranges"},{"text":"Basic Power Pivot"},{"text":"Dashboard creation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bank reconciliation"},{"text":"Vendor reconciliation"},{"text":"Customer aging"},{"text":"GST reconciliation"},{"text":"Expense analysis"},{"text":"Monthly reporting"},{"text":"Budget vs actuals"},{"text":"Payroll analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"ERP Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Tally is useful for SMEs, but larger organizations commonly use enterprise ERP platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP S/4HANA"},{"text":"Oracle ERP"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"},{"text":"Zoho Books"},{"text":"QuickBooks"},{"text":"Other accounting/ERP platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important ERP Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chart of accounts"},{"text":"General ledger"},{"text":"Accounts payable"},{"text":"Accounts receivable"},{"text":"Asset accounting"},{"text":"Cost centres"},{"text":"Profit centres"},{"text":"Purchase-to-pay"},{"text":"Order-to-cash"},{"text":"Record-to-report"},{"text":"Approval workflows"},{"text":"User access"},{"text":"Audit trails"}]}]},{"heading":"SAP Finance Direction","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the student wants to move beyond Tally into enterprise accounting, learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"h","text":"SAP FI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"General Ledger"},{"text":"Accounts Payable"},{"text":"Accounts Receivable"},{"text":"Asset Accounting"},{"text":"Bank Accounting"},{"text":"Financial reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SAP CO"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cost centres"},{"text":"Profit centres"},{"text":"Internal orders"},{"text":"Cost allocation"},{"text":"Profitability analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future SAP Finance/ERP Consultant path requires substantially deeper ERP configuration and business-process knowledge than an Accounts Executive role."}]},{"heading":"MIS & Financial Reporting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Daily sales report"},{"text":"Purchase report"},{"text":"Expense report"},{"text":"Cash-flow summary"},{"text":"Receivables report"},{"text":"Payables report"},{"text":"Outstanding report"},{"text":"Inventory report"},{"text":"Monthly P&L summary"},{"text":"Management dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reporting Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Transactions","Accounting System","Reconciliation","Validation","MIS","Management Decision"]}]},{"heading":"Accounting Data Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL basics"},{"tex