 & Compliance Data","Financial Statements","Power BI MIS Dashboard"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TallyPrime"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"ERP concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This project demonstrates that the graduate can do more than basic accounting data entry."}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chartered Accountant firms"},{"text":"Accounting firms"},{"text":"SMEs"},{"text":"Corporate finance departments"},{"text":"Shared Service Centres"},{"text":"GCCs"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"Retail companies"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"ERP implementation companies"},{"text":"Finance/BPO operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounts Intern"},{"text":"Finance Intern"},{"text":"Tally Intern"},{"text":"Accounts Payable Intern"},{"text":"Accounts Receivable Intern"},{"text":"Taxation Intern"},{"text":"MIS Intern"},{"text":"Finance Operations Intern"},{"text":"ERP Finance Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"High-Value Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TallyPrime"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"GST fundamentals"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"SAP FI fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Qualifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on long-term goals:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CA"},{"text":"CMA"},{"text":"ACCA"},{"text":"CIMA"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a standard Accounts Executive position, these professional qualifications are not mandatory, but they can substantially improve progression toward senior accounting, audit, financial reporting and controllership roles."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Com - Computer Applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounts Executive"},{"text":"Accounts Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Accountant"},{"text":"Finance Executive"},{"text":"Accounts Payable Executive"},{"text":"Accounts Receivable Executive"},{"text":"Billing Executive"},{"text":"Taxation Executive"},{"text":"MIS Executive"},{"text":"Finance Operations Executive"},{"text":"Tally Executive"},{"text":"ERP Accounts Executive"},{"text":"Junior Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Payroll Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Academic"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Taxation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Financial Management"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CA"},{"text":"CMA"},{"text":"ACCA"},{"text":"CIMA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ERP Specialization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP Finance"},{"text":"Oracle Financials"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics Finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an Accounts Executive who wants faster progression, a professional accounting qualification or ERP specialization can be more directly useful than pursuing an unrelated master's degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant programs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Accounting"},{"text":"MSc Accounting & Finance"},{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Financial Management"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Information Systems"},{"text":"MSc Enterprise Resource Planning"},{"text":"MSc Accounting Information Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","t