ial Accounting"},{"text":"Corporate Accounting"},{"text":"Cost Accounting"},{"text":"Financial Statements"},{"text":"Reconciliation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Taxation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"Income-tax fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TallyPrime"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ERP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP FI fundamentals"},{"text":"Oracle/Dynamics concepts"},{"text":"AP/AR"},{"text":"GL"},{"text":"Asset Accounting"},{"text":"P2P"},{"text":"O2C"},{"text":"R2R"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial reporting"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"},{"text":"Internal controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Portfolio Target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"TallyPrime practical experience"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"GST/TDS fundamentals"},{"text":"AP/AR knowledge"},{"text":"Bank reconciliation experience"},{"text":"ERP fundamentals"},{"text":"Power BI reporting"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"At least 1 accounting/finance internship"},{"text":"2–3 practical accounting projects"},{"text":"One complete ERP/accounting capstone"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Computer Applications","Accounting Fundamentals","TallyPrime","Excel","GST/TDS","AP/AR","Bank Reconciliation","ERP","SAP FI Fundamentals","Power BI","SQL","Financial Reporting","Internship","Accounts Executive","Senior Accounts Executive","Accountant / ERP Finance Analyst","Finance Manager / ERP Consultant"]},{"type":"table","header":["ID","Level","Stream","Degree","Course / Specialisation","Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"1133"},{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Commerce"},{"text":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commer